# ---- Achievements (vanilla system, own page in the achievement GUI: MNGA) ----
# Key format: achievement.<name>=title ; achievement.<name>.desc=description
# <name> is the second argument of new Achievement in ModAchievements.
achievement.mnga_scheelite_mined=Wu!
achievement.mnga_scheelite_mined.desc=Your first scheelite ore. It will not smelt into anything. Go crush it.

achievement.mnga_scheelite_acid=Can I Drink This?
achievement.mnga_scheelite_acid.desc=Tungstic acid. A yellow filter cake, and a terrible beverage.

achievement.mnga_tungsten_carbide=High Strength Tungsten Carbide
achievement.mnga_tungsten_carbide.desc=A tungsten carbide ingot. Second highest melting point, hardest thing around.

achievement.mnga_nothing_smelt=Rolling Log?
achievement.mnga_nothing_smelt.desc=You put scheelite in a furnace. The furnace finished smelting it and handed you nothing at all.

achievement.mnga_scheelite_300=That Is All Of It
achievement.mnga_scheelite_300.desc=Three hundred scheelite blocks mined. About half a large vein.

achievement.mnga_waste_acid=I Should Soak The World In Acid
achievement.mnga_waste_acid.desc=Sixteen tungsten acid cakes, roughly ten thousand millibuckets of waste acid. Do not drink it.

achievement.mnga_beryllium_conc=A Buried Story
achievement.mnga_beryllium_conc.desc=You pulled a beryllium concentrate out of the leach residue. Beryllium is rarer than tungsten.

achievement.mnga_arsenic_cake=Do Not Lick
achievement.mnga_arsenic_cake.desc=Arsenic trioxide, white arsenic. Wash your hands afterwards.

achievement.mnga_arsenic_nugget=Bought With Blood
achievement.mnga_arsenic_nugget.desc=Reduced white arsenic down to arsenic nuggets. Arsenic bronze and gallium arsenide are waiting.

achievement.mnga_seawater=That Is Not Water
achievement.mnga_seawater.desc=The environmental pump pulled up seawater. It picks its output by biome, not by what is under it.

achievement.mnga_chlorine=Both Will Kill You
achievement.mnga_chlorine.desc=Electrolysed chlorine. Lye comes out the other side. Neither is safe to touch.

achievement.mnga_lithium=It Starts With Lithium
achievement.mnga_lithium.desc=Lithium powder from ore liquor. Batteries, grease and tritium breeding all start here.

achievement.mnga_zinc=My Heart Is In Pieces!
achievement.mnga_zinc.desc=After the sinter crumbles, the zinc stays behind as oxide in that pile of ash.

achievement.mnga_hover=I Can Fly
achievement.mnga_hover.desc=You lifted off with the powered hover pack. It will not hold you forever - the power runs out.

achievement.mnga_escape_abyss=Escape The Abyss
achievement.mnga_escape_abyss.desc=Nicotine poisoning. You ascended, or at least skipped the death screen.

achievement.mnga_fork_shock=Tingling Sensation
achievement.mnga_fork_shock.desc=This careless soul fried himself trying to fish like a fish.

achievement.mnga_pump_overworked=A Thankless Job
achievement.mnga_pump_overworked.desc=She does not look happy. Wonder why?

achievement.mnga_sea_dredge=Sea Scoop
achievement.mnga_sea_dredge.desc=You hauled a deep sea nodule up from the bottom. Crack it open - it is all metal.

achievement.mnga_big_is_good=Bigger Is Better
achievement.mnga_big_is_good.desc=Place a large catalytic chemical factory or a hybrid catalytic fraction tower.

achievement.mnga_absolute_zero=Absolute Zero
achievement.mnga_absolute_zero.desc=Solidify helium into something you can actually hold.

achievement.mnga_helicopter=MAN!
achievement.mnga_helicopter.desc=You built a helicopter.

achievement.mnga_pump_strike=She Quit
achievement.mnga_pump_strike.desc=You put her above the clouds. She did the math, decided it wasn't worth it, and sat down.

achievement.mnga_helicopter_elements=HeLiCoPtEr
achievement.mnga_helicopter_elements.desc=Helium Helium Lithium Cobalt Platinum Erbium. Try saying it. No prize if you get it right.

achievement.mnga_ruin_estate=Ruin Real Estate
achievement.mnga_ruin_estate.desc=Forty blocks under the lava, a building nobody wanted. You furnished it.

